    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1263460421": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "The hospital’s full of ears and cameras. I have a private facility by the harbor... warehouse 12B.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "528224766": {
   "kind": "choice",
   "parent": -1,
   "children": [
    -1273735527,
    178849838,
    509592464
   ],
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I’ll explain everything there. Bring discretion. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_HideUnavailable": false,
    "m_HideVisited": false,
    "m_SkipChoice": false,
    "m_ShuffleChoices": false,
    "m_TimedChoice": {
     "m_TimedChoice": false,
     "m_Duration": {
      "kind": "value",
      "value": 10
     },
     "m_Timeout": "ChooseRandom"
    },
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-9885634": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1061625545,
   "children": [
    -709416151
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You sound like you were waiting for me.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-984169928": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1061625545,
   "children": [
    730804618
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You could’ve called instead of ambushing me in a hallway.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "730804618": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -984169928,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "If I wanted your opinion on my methods, I’d dissect it out of you. What matters is that I require your assistance.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-709416151": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -9885634,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Waiting implies emotion. I don’t waste time on that. I simply needed you for something… delicate.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1972376667": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 1061625545,
   "children": [
    1793244000,
    1978881810
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "If you wanted a date, doc, you could’ve just asked.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1793244000": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1972376667,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "A date? No. I don’t date. I conduct controlled experiments. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1978881810": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1972376667,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 1,
   "expressionName": "Happy",
   "text": "Though I admit, the two often produce similar results.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1273735527": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    536083308
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You make it sound like we’re doing something illegal.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "536083308": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1273735527,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Illegal? Maybe. Unethical? Possibly. Depends on how strong your stomach is.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "178849838": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    833537285
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "If this is some shady shit, I’m out.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "833537285": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 178849838,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 4,
   "expressionName": "Flirty",
   "text": "You’re free to decline. But if you walk away, you’ll never know what the human body is truly capable of.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "509592464": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 528224766,
   "children": [
    2097611685
   ],
   "actor": null,
   "text": "You sure this isn’t a setup for something dirtier?",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "2097611685": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": 509592464,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "If that were my intent, I’d at least have the decency to sterilize the instruments first.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "134361379": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "DrFrost",
   "expression": 2,
   "expressionName": "Angry",
   "text": "Don't let me wait, {PC}.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
